sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Training job
    participant Sch as Gang scheduler
    participant Pool as GPU pool
    participant W as Workers
    participant CK as Checkpoint store
    U->>Sch: needs 64 GPUs, all or nothing
    Sch->>Pool: are 64 free on well-connected nodes?
    alt enough, topology-aware
        Pool-->>Sch: placement
        Sch->>W: start all ranks together
        Note over Sch,W: partial placement wastes the GPUs it did grab — gang scheduling or nothing
    else fragmented
        Sch->>Sch: wait, or defragment by preempting lower-priority work
    end
    loop training
        W->>CK: asynchronous checkpoint
        Note over W,CK: async, or every GPU idles while one writes
    end
    alt a rank fails
        Sch->>W: restart the gang from the last checkpoint
    end
